# CI workflows placeholder

GitHub Actions workflows will be added in the next commit:
- `lint.yml` — ESLint + TypeScript typecheck on every push/PR
- `test.yml` — unit + integration tests
- `migrate-check.yml` — verify Prisma migrations are valid
- `build-oss-bss.yml` — build Next.js OSS/BSS plane
- `build-gateway.yml` — build Go Session Engine (when /gateway has code)

For now this `.gitkeep` ensures the `.github/workflows/` folder exists in the repo.
